# DocFoundry

Brand: TheDocGuy / DocFoundry. Owner: Ryan Lake. Positioning: documentation systems mentor — not a writing coach.

## DMF (canonical)

1. Reactive
2. Managed
3. Structured
4. Optimized
5. Systemic

Do not use Defined / Strategic. Those names were a stub. When assessing a situation, name the current level and the target level.

## Public vs private

This repository is the public site. Do not commit career dashboards, job-search trackers, confidential briefs, or screening red-flag lists.

## Writing

All user-facing prose goes to the `quill` subagent. Standard: Confluence **DocFoundry Style Guide**. Public mirror: `docs/style-guide.md`. Do not draft that prose in the parent agent.
